easel (1.0.4) stonking; urgency=low

  * A selection, text box or waiting shape now uses far less CPU while idle.
  * The picture, grid, guides, Transparent mode and color changes in an open
    text box or a lifted selection now redraw at once instead of waiting for
    the next movement.

